{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T13:29:10.023Z","data":{"text":"Done. Summary of the work:\n\n**Config module (`src/core/foundation/config-vcs.ts`, new)**\n- `VcsConfig`, `DEFAULT_VCS_CONFIG` (`{ enabled: false }`), `DEFAULT_GIT_COMMIT_SECONDS` (120), `validateVcsConfig`.\n- Modeled on `validateGatesConfig`: partial blocks keep defaults; rejects non-boolean `enabled`, malformed author, missing author when enabled, and blank/non-string `worktreeRoot`/`prepare`; trims the two path/command fields. Error wording matches the delta verbatim.\n\n**Agent config (`src/core/foundation/config-agents.ts`, new)**\n- `AgyConfig` and `OpencodeConfig` moved here; `config.ts` re-exports both so all existing imports resolve.\n\n**`config.ts`** (244 lines, under budget)\n- `OsqTimeouts.gitCommitSeconds?`, `OsqConfig.vcs`, `DEFAULT_CONFIG.vcs`, and `defineConfig` sets `vcs: validateVcsConfig(config.vcs)`.\n\n**`config-user.ts`** — accepts a partial `vcs` block. **`src/index.ts`** — exports the `VcsConfig` type.\n\n**`tests/vcs-config.test.ts`** (new) — the three delta scenarios through `loadConfig`, plus trimming, blank `prepare`, non-boolean `enabled`, the timeout default/override, and type exports.\n\n**Verification:** `node --import tsx --test tests/vcs-config.test.ts` passes (9/9), and `pnpm verify` (typechecks, build, full suite, lint) passes.\n\n**Noted deviation:** `OsqConfig.vcs` is optional rather than required because preexisting `tests/opencode-config.test.ts` builds an `OsqConfig` without it and is outside scope; loaded/defined configs still always carry `vcs`.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/088-vcs-config-and-writes/.run/results/1.md`."}}
